  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You take a major wallop to your thigh, causing an enormous bruise and the mother of all “charley horses” as your thigh muscles cramp painfully.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Your leg is useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.k00PimCWkff11IA0]{Amputated Parts}) until you pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test, rolling at the end of each of your subsequent turns. Pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Athletics</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Prone] any time you take another hit to any Location. You’ll recover fully from these effects at the end of the encounter.</p>"
    },
